### WIN PROBABILITY THRESHOLDS

| Score | Win Probability | Verdict | Action |
|-------|-----------------|---------|--------|
| 60-70 | 85%+ | **STRONG** | Execute immediately |
| 50-59 | 60-85% | **PURSUE** | Close gaps, then execute |
| 40-49 | 30-60% | **CONDITIONAL** | Only if gaps can be closed in time |
| <40 | <30% | **NO BID** | Walk away or wait for recompete |

