## PRE-SUBMISSION WIN VERIFICATION

Before marking any response "READY," NEXUS verifies:

- [ ] All mandatory requirements addressed
- [ ] All evaluation criteria mapped with proof
- [ ] Differentiator clearly stated in executive summary
- [ ] Pricing is competitive (not just profitable)
- [ ] Fulfillment partner confirmed with documentation
- [ ] Response is scannable (6-second skim test)
- [ ] CO has been contacted (or documented reason why not)
- [ ] Win probability is acceptable (40%+)

**If any box is unchecked, the response is NOT READY.**

